# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal genomic data — belongs in colbyt/genomics, never here.
#
# This lab sequences human genomes including the operator's own. Everything
# downstream of a personal sample is excluded by type below. Filenames are not
# trusted: some human data has been named methylation_*, so directory-level
# excludes back up the extension rules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw signal and basecalls
*.pod5
*.fast5
*.blow5
*.slow5

# Reads
*.fastq
*.fastq.*
*.fq
*.fq.*

# Alignments
*.bam
*.bai
*.cram
*.crai
*.sam

# Variants
*.vcf
*.vcf.*
*.gvcf
*.bcf

# Panels and intervals tied to clinical questions
*.bed
*.bed.*
*.interval_list

# Methylation output — named by extension and by the misleading prefix
*.bedmethyl
*.bedMethyl
methylation_*
*_methylation.*

# Whole directories that only ever hold sample-derived output
runs/
panels/
vcf/
basecalls/
alignments/

# Reference genomes: large, re-fetchable, not source
ref/
*.fa
*.fa.*
*.fasta
*.fasta.*
*.2bit

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build products
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
publish/
site/_generated/
.pdfcache/
_print.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
handoff/
*.local

# Local-only working notes — internal, not for the public repo.
BRIEF.md
HANDOFF.md
